vanitygaps (https://codeberg.org/dwl/dwl-patches/src/branch/main/patches/vanitygaps),
both upstream commits squashed ("Implement vanitygaps" and "allow gaps in
monocle layout if requested"), refreshed to apply on top of 03..81.

Inner and outer gaps per monitor, adjustable at runtime with incgaps and
friends, togglegaps/defaultgaps, plus smartgaps and monoclegaps options.

